  "title": "New Pacific Files Form 40-F Annual Report - New Pacific Metals Corp.",
  "summary": "Download PDF Version VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA – SEPTEMBER 15, 2025 New Pacific Metals Corp. (“New Pacific” or the “Company”) reports that the Company has filed today its fiscal 2025 annual report on Form 40-F with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (“SEC”). The Form 40-F, which includes the Company’s fiscal 2025 annual audited financial statements, management’s discussion and analysis, and annual information form, is available on the Company’s website at[…]",
